      "title": "SMPP: Handle decoding packed 7-bit GSM with UDH correctly",
      "message": "SMPP: Handle decoding packed 7-bit GSM with UDH correctly\n\nSMPP only has the number of octets of the message payload, but\nwith packed 7-bit GSM with a UDH, there are fill bits after the\nUDH before the message (to align the message start with a septet\nboundary), and we need to calculate the number of septets.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2022-06-12T18:28:55.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "A Wireshark GitLab Utility",
